{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>CHAIN — 30-second pitch</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;overflow:hidden;background:#101210}#root{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#101210;color:#f1eee6;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}.clip{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}.scene{opacity:0}.heavy{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-8px}.label{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:5px}.body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:45px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-1px}.lime{fill:#c4fc58}.paper{fill:#f1eee6}.ink{fill:#101210}.line{fill:none;stroke:#f1eee6;stroke-width:3}.link{fill:none;stroke:#c4fc58;stroke-width:52}.thin{fill:none;stroke:#c4fc58;stroke-width:3}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"main\" data-width=\"1920\" data-height=\"1080\" data-duration=\"30\">\n<div class=\"clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"30\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1920 1080\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A pitch for Chain, an on-chain entertainment platform\">\n<defs>\n<pattern id=\"grid\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M100 0H0V100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f1eee6\" stroke-opacity=\".065\"/></pattern>\n<clipPath id=\"stage\"><rect width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"/></clipPath>\n</defs>\n<g clip-path=\"url(#stage)\">\n<rect width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#101210\"/>\n<g id=\"ambient\"><rect x=\"-200\" y=\"-200\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1500\" fill=\"url(#grid)\"/></g>\n<g id=\"intro\" class=\"scene\">\n<g id=\"introLinks\" opacity=\".35\" transform=\"translate(1320 510) rotate(-35)\"><rect x=\"-325\" y=\"-300\" width=\"370\" height=\"600\" rx=\"185\" class=\"link\"/><rect x=\"-20\" y=\"-100\" width=\"370\" height=\"600\" rx=\"185\" class=\"link\"/></g>\n<text id=\"introA\" x=\"130\" y=\"350\" font-size=\"170\" class=\"heavy paper\">EVERY</text>\n<text id=\"introB\" x=\"130\" y=\"525\" font-size=\"170\" class=\"heavy paper\">OUTCOME.</text>\n<text id=\"introC\" x=\"130\" y=\"700\" font-size=\"170\" class=\"heavy lime\">ON-CHAIN.</text>\n<path id=\"introRule\" d=\"M140 810H1760\" stroke=\"#c4fc58\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n</g>\n<g id=\"brand\" class=\"scene\">\n<rect id=\"brandPanel\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#c4fc58\"/>\n<g id=\"brandMark\" transform=\"translate(960 270) rotate(-35)\"><rect x=\"-115\" y=\"-115\" width=\"140\" height=\"230\" rx=\"70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#101210\" stroke-width=\"28\"/><rect x=\"-5\" y=\"-35\" width=\"140\" height=\"230\" rx=\"70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#101210\" stroke-width=\"28\"/></g>\n<text id=\"brandName\" x=\"960\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"350\" class=\"heavy ink\">CHAIN</text>\n<text id=\"brandDesc\" x=\"960\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"53\" font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"3\" class=\"ink\">ON-CHAIN ENTERTAINMENT</text>\n</g>\n<g id=\"proof\" class=\"scene\">\n<text x=\"135\" y=\"190\" class=\"label lime\">PROVABLY FAIR</text>\n<text id=\"proofA\" x=\"125\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"151\" class=\"heavy paper\">DON’T GUESS.</text>\n<text id=\"proofB\" x=\"125\" y=\"575\" font-size=\"151\" class=\"heavy lime\">VERIFY.</text>\n<text id=\"proofCopy\" x=\"140\" y=\"730\" class=\"body paper\"><tspan x=\"140\">Every outcome verifiable</tspan><tspan x=\"140\" dy=\"62\">on-chain.</tspan></text>\n<g id=\"proofSeal\" transform=\"translate(1500 770)\"><circle r=\"156\" class=\"thin\"/><circle r=\"125\" fill=\"#c4fc58\"/><path id=\"check\" d=\"M-63 0L-15 49L70-53\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#101210\" stroke-width=\"20\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\"/></g>\n<path id=\"proofRail\" d=\"M142 920H1760\" stroke=\"#f1eee6\" stroke-opacity=\".2\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n</g>\n<g id=\"transparency\" class=\"scene\">\n<text x=\"135\" y=\"180\" class=\"label lime\">FULLY TRANSPARENT</text>\n<text id=\"transA\" x=\"125\" y=\"380\" font-size=\"146\" class=\"heavy paper\">WAGERS.</text>\n<text id=\"transB\" x=\"125\" y=\"535\" font-size=\"146\" class=\"heavy paper\">PAYOUTS.</text>\n<text id=\"transC\" x=\"125\" y=\"690\" font-size=\"146\" class=\"heavy lime\">PUBLIC.</text>\n<text id=\"transCopy\" x=\"140\" y=\"865\" class=\"body paper\">Recorded on the blockchain.</text>\n<g id=\"blocks\" transform=\"translate(1240 320)\">\n<path id=\"blockLine\" d=\"M160 0V560\" stroke=\"#c4fc58\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n<g id=\"block1\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"155\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#1c2119\" stroke=\"#c4fc58\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M55 55H215M55 95H265\" stroke=\"#c4fc58\" stroke-width=\"12\"/></g>\n<g id=\"block2\"><rect x=\"45\" y=\"205\" width=\"320\" height=\"155\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#1c2119\" stroke=\"#c4fc58\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M100 260H260M100 300H310\" stroke=\"#c4fc58\" stroke-width=\"12\"/></g>\n<g id=\"block3\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"410\" width=\"320\" height=\"155\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#1c2119\" stroke=\"#c4fc58\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M55 465H215M55 505H265\" stroke=\"#c4fc58\" stroke-width=\"12\"/></g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g id=\"wallet\" class=\"scene\">\n<text x=\"135\" y=\"180\" class=\"label lime\">SELF-CUSTODY PLAY</text>\n<text id=\"walletA\" x=\"125\" y=\"390\" font-size=\"157\" class=\"heavy paper\">YOUR WALLET.</text>\n<text id=\"walletB\" x=\"125\" y=\"555\" font-size=\"157\" class=\"heavy lime\">YOUR CONTROL.</text>\n<text id=\"walletCopy\" x=\"140\" y=\"735\" class=\"body paper\">Play straight from your wallet.</text>\n<g id=\"walletArt\" transform=\"translate(1340 735)\"><rect x=\"-60\" y=\"-100\" width=\"410\" height=\"240\" rx=\"35\" fill=\"#c4fc58\"/><path d=\"M-60-42H350\" stroke=\"#101210\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"-15\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#101210\" stroke=\"#c4fc58\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"255\" cy=\"35\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#c4fc58\"/></g>\n</g>\n<g id=\"ending\" class=\"scene\">\n<rect id=\"endPanel\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" fill=\"#c4fc58\"/>\n<text id=\"endTop\" x=\"960\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"label ink\">EXPLORE THE DEVNET</text>\n<text id=\"endName\" x=\"960\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"330\" class=\"heavy ink\">CHAIN</text>\n<g id=\"endAddress\"><rect x=\"540\" y=\"650\" width=\"840\" height=\"145\" rx=\"73\" fill=\"#101210\"/><text x=\"960\" y=\"747\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"76\" font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"-3\" class=\"lime\">chain.wtf ↗</text></g>\n<text id=\"endHandle\" x=\"960\" y=\"910\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"39\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"ink\">@chaindotwtf</text>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n'use strict';\nconst tl=gsap.timeline({paused:true});\nconst reveal=(selector,start,duration=0.6,offset=90)=>tl.fromTo(selector,{opacity:0,y:offset},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:duration,ease:'power3.out',immediateRender:false},start);\nconst scene=(selector,start,end)=>{tl.set(selector,{opacity:1},start);if(end<30)tl.set(selector,{opacity:0},end);};\ntl.to('#ambient',{x:100,y:65,duration:30,ease:'none'},0);\nscene('#intro',0,4.5);\nreveal('#introA',0.05,0.7,130);reveal('#introB',0.3,0.7,130);reveal('#introC',0.7,0.75,130);\ntl.fromTo('#introLinks',{rotation:-18,scale:0.75,opacity:0},{rotation:0,scale:1,opacity:0.35,duration:2.4,ease:'power3.out',svgOrigin:'1320 510',immediateRender:false},0);\ntl.fromTo('#introRule',{scaleX:0},{scaleX:1,transformOrigin:'left center',duration:1.1,ease:'power3.inOut',immediateRender:false},1.55);\ntl.to(['#introA','#introB','#introC'],{y:-45,opacity:0,duration:0.3,stagger:0.05,ease:'power2.in'},4.05);\nscene('#brand',4.5,8.5);\ntl.fromTo('#brandPanel',{x:1920},{x:0,duration:0.5,ease:'power4.out',immediateRender:false},4.5);\nreveal('#brandName',4.8,0.75,170);reveal('#brandDesc',5.3,0.6,40);\ntl.fromTo('#brandMark',{scale:0,rotation:-40},{scale:1,rotation:0,duration:0.85,ease:'back.out(1.2)',svgOrigin:'960 270',immediateRender:false},5.1);\ntl.to('#brandName',{scale:1.025,svgOrigin:'960 560',duration:2.3,ease:'none'},5.8);\nscene('#proof',8.5,14);\nreveal('#proofA',8.65,0.65,100);reveal('#proofB',9.05,0.65,100);reveal('#proofCopy',9.8,0.6,35);\ntl.fromTo('#proofSeal',{scale:0.15,opacity:0},{scale:1,opacity:1,duration:0.85,ease:'back.out(1.3)',svgOrigin:'1500 770',immediateRender:false},10.3);\ntl.fromTo('#check',{strokeDasharray:210,strokeDashoffset:210},{strokeDashoffset:0,duration:0.65,ease:'power2.out',immediateRender:false},10.9);\ntl.to('#proofSeal',{rotation:12,svgOrigin:'1500 770',duration:2.3,ease:'sine.inOut'},11.6);\nscene('#transparency',14,20);\nreveal('#transA',14.15,0.55,100);reveal('#transB',14.5,0.55,100);reveal('#transC',14.9,0.65,100);reveal('#transCopy',15.65,0.6,30);\ntl.fromTo('#blockLine',{scaleY:0},{scaleY:1,transformOrigin:'top center',duration:1.2,ease:'power2.inOut',immediateRender:false},15.4);\nreveal('#block1',15.4,0.65,45);reveal('#block2',15.9,0.65,45);reveal('#block3',16.4,0.65,45);\ntl.to('#blocks',{y:-18,duration:2.5,ease:'sine.inOut'},17.3);\nscene('#wallet',20,25);\nreveal('#walletA',20.15,0.65,100);reveal('#walletB',20.55,0.65,100);reveal('#walletCopy',21.3,0.6,30);\ntl.fromTo('#walletArt',{x:180,rotation:10,opacity:0},{x:0,rotation:0,opacity:1,duration:0.9,ease:'power3.out',svgOrigin:'1485 750',immediateRender:false},21.65);\ntl.to('#walletArt',{y:-15,duration:1.8,ease:'sine.inOut'},23);\nscene('#ending',25,30);\ntl.fromTo('#endPanel',{y:1080},{y:0,duration:0.55,ease:'power4.out',immediateRender:false},25);\nreveal('#endTop',25.45,0.6,35);reveal('#endName',25.55,0.8,140);reveal('#endAddress',26.15,0.7,60);reveal('#endHandle',26.7,0.6,25);\ntl.to('#endName',{scale:1.018,svgOrigin:'960 440',duration:2.6,ease:'none'},27.4);\nwindow.__timelines=window.__timelines||{};\nwindow.__timelines['main']=tl;\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","width":1920,"height":1080,"duration_seconds":30,"assumptions":["Chosen format: 1920×1080 landscape, 30 seconds, silent kinetic typography with original SVG artwork and an editorial lime/charcoal palette; no official visual identity was supplied.","Product research source: https://www.chain.wtf/casino — its official page describes on-chain entertainment, verifiable outcomes, public wagers and payouts, self-custody play, and a live devnet. Those statements support the film’s copy; availability and performance claims beyond them are omitted.","The supplied handle is associated with Chain.wtf in public search results. The final CTA explicitly refers to the devnet.","No external images, screenshots, official logo files, fonts, or audio are used. The chain-link symbol is original illustrative artwork, not a verified official logo. No third-party asset license is asserted; brand-name and trademark permissions were not supplied.","Uses the harness-provided gsap.min.js. This source has not been rendered or visually reviewed."],"missing_inputs":[],"summary":"Editable 30-second Chain pitch featuring on-chain verification, transparency, self-custody, and a devnet CTA."}